1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Keyword: Prepare

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,580
Heroes with Prepare trigger their effects
in each round's preparation phase,

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:09,320
granting the corresponding
benefits to your lineup.

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:13,560
A Prepare hero you just played,
such as Cao Cao,

5
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,900
will not trigger Prepare immediately.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,100
It must wait until
the next preparation phase.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,340
Certain effect cards or hero cards
can trigger Prepare immediately,

8
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,982
without waiting for the next round.
